\title{Covers measured by the increment}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{\ref{fdip-00D2} compares squared increments with arc length.
The circle can be covered by short arcs. Once distances are
taken from the [increment metric](fdip-00CY), how large is such
a cover, and what value does that size assign to the whole
circle?}
